# A paste waits for a held modifier. The keyboard goes away: nothing is held,
# so the paste runs at once.
0 in sock connect
0 in key KEY_CAPSLOCK down
0 out key KEY_LEFTCTRL down
100 in sock paste
200 in lost
200 out key KEY_LEFTCTRL up
200 out key KEY_LEFTSHIFT down
200 out key KEY_INSERT down
200 out key KEY_INSERT up
200 out key KEY_LEFTSHIFT up
200 out sock pasted
